%% A student runs a solution: messages between the processes of VygOJ
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Browser
    participant Frontend
    participant Database as PostgreSQL
    participant Backend
    participant Engine as Engine container

    Student->>Browser: presses Run
    Browser->>Frontend: POST /problem/course/problem<br>{action: run, language, code}
    Frontend->>Database: check the limits of runs (row of the user locked)
    alt same code as the last run
        Database-->>Frontend: stored result
    else new code
        Frontend->>Frontend: save the code, commit it to the student repo
        Frontend->>Backend: POST /run {problem, solution, context}<br>to a random backend of BACKENDS
        Backend->>Engine: create a container without network
        loop compile, then each test case
            Backend->>Engine: docker exec with time limit
            Engine-->>Backend: outputs, time, memory
        end
        Backend->>Engine: remove the container
        Backend-->>Frontend: ExecutionResult (compact JSON)
        Frontend->>Database: store the result and the grade
        Frontend->>Frontend: log the run event
    end
    Frontend-->>Browser: ExecutionResult
    Browser-->>Student: verdict of each test case
